      "short": "$4x$",
      "worked": "The HCF is $4x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}4x^2+8x &= 4x(x+2)\\\\\\text{Width} &= \\frac{4x(x+2)}{x+2}\\\\\\text{Width} &= 4x\\end{align*}$$",
